  (text "Radxa ZERO 3E V1.2 sheet 16 (RGMII): RTL8211F-CG + discrete magnetics + RJ45.\nThe four magnetics centre taps TR0..TR3_48V are the PoE pick-off. On the 3E they leave the board through\nmounting posts 1M1/1M4 to the PoE HAT; on the Commander they go straight to the on-board PD (30_poe.net)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.4 0)
